      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{6164ea6864fa800d425cecbb|full_name}: Afaik VRChat doesn't locally calculate the IK for remote players. The bones are synced directly.\n\nVRChat doesn't sync the trackingdata required to drive the IK. In Udon if you try to fetch a remote player's trackingdata it will return a bone position instead.",
